 include/MGIS/Behaviour/Integrate.hxx          | 92 ++++++++++---------
 include/MGIS/LibrariesManager.hxx             | 11 ++-
 src/Integrate.cxx                             |  8 +-
 7 files changed, 88 insertions(+), 62 deletions(-)

